#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:105
msgid "What Happens Automatically"
msgstr "Qué Happens Automatically"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:46
msgid "When a new HPE Clustered Datastore is created:"
msgstr "Cuando un nuevo HPE Clustered Almacén de datos es creado:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:48
msgid ""
"**GFS2 formatting** — ``mkfs.gfs2`` is run with lock_dlm protocol, 2048 "
"resource groups, and 32 initial journals, with the lock table tied to the "
"cluster"
msgstr ""
"**GFS2 formatting** — ``mkfs.gfs2`` es ejecutar con lock_dlm protocolo, 2048"
" recurso groups, y 32 initial journals, con el lock table tied al cluster"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:49
msgid ""
"**Journal provisioning** — Journals are added (``gfs2_jadd``) if the initial"
" journal count is less than the number of hosts"
msgstr ""
"**Journal provisioning** — Journals son agregado (``gfs2_jadd``) si el "
"initial journal cantidad es menos de el número de hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Mount on all hosts** — The filesystem is mounted on each cluster host. "
"Mount information is persisted to ``/opt/morpheus-node/.mounts``"
msgstr ""
"**Mount on all hosts** — El filesystem es mounted en cada cluster host. "
"Mount información es persisted a ``/opt/morpheus-node/.mounts``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:51
msgid ""
"**libvirt storage pool** — A virsh storage pool is created on each host, "
"making the datastore available for VM disk placement"
msgstr ""
"**libvirt storage pool** — Un virsh storage pool es creado en cada host, "
"making el datastore disponible para VM disco placement"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Lock protocol** — The ``lock_dlm`` protocol coordinates file locking "
"across all hosts through the existing DLM infrastructure"
msgstr ""
"**Lock protocolo** — El ``lock_dlm`` protocolo coordinates archivo locking a"
" través de todos hosts a través de el existente DLM infrastructure"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:55
msgid "Adding iSCSI Targets"
msgstr "Adding iSCSI Targets"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:57
msgid ""
"iSCSI targets provide the block device access that underpins HPE Clustered "
"Datastores."
msgstr ""
"iSCSI targets proporcionar el bloquear device acceso ese underpins HPE "
"Clustered Almacenes de datos."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:62
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:100
msgid ""
"Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Storage > iSCSI``"
msgstr ""
"Navegue un ``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Storage > iSCSI``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:63
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Add`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`Agregar`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:64
msgid "Enter the iSCSI target details:"
msgstr "Ingresar el iSCSI destino details:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:72
msgid "Target IP"
msgstr "Destino IP"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:73
msgid "IP address of the iSCSI target portal"
msgstr "IP dirección del iSCSI destino portal"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:74
msgid "Target Port"
msgstr "Destino Port"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:75
msgid "Port number (default: 3260)"
msgstr "Port número (predeterminado: 3260)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:82
msgid "When an iSCSI target is added:"
msgstr "Cuando un iSCSI destino es agregado:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:84
msgid ""
"**Discovery** — ``iscsiadm -m discovery -t st -p \"<IP>:<port>\"`` is run on"
" all online cluster hosts"
msgstr ""
"**Discovery** — ``iscsiadm -m discovery -t st -p \"<IP>:<port>\"`` es "
"ejecutar en todos online cluster hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:85
msgid ""
"**Auto-login** — Sessions are configured for automatic startup and all "
"available targets are logged in (``iscsiadm -m node --loginall=automatic``)"
msgstr ""
"**Auto-login** — Sessions están configurados para automático startup y todos"
" disponible targets son logged en (``iscsiadm -m node "
"--loginall=automatic``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:86
msgid "**Persistence** — Target connections persist across host reboots"
msgstr "**Persistence** — Destino conexiones persist a través de host reboots"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:88
msgid ""
"iSCSI targets are automatically discovered on all hosts in the cluster, not "
"just a single host. This ensures all hosts can access the shared storage "
"simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"iSCSI targets son automáticamente discovered en todos hosts en el cluster, "
"no solo un single host. Este ensures todos hosts puede acceso el shared "
"storage simultaneously."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:91
msgid "Removing iSCSI Targets"
msgstr "Removing iSCSI Targets"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:93
msgid ""
"Before removing an iSCSI target, ensure no datastores are using LUNs from "
"that target. Removing a target with active datastores will cause storage "
"failures."
msgstr ""
"Antes de removing un iSCSI destino, asegurar no datastores son usando LUNs "
"desde ese destino. Removing un destino con activo datastores será cause "
"storage failures."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:98
msgid "Migrate all VMs off datastores using the target's LUNs"
msgstr "Migrate todos VMs off datastores usando el destino's LUNs"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:99
msgid ""
"Remove the datastore from |morpheus| (see `Removing a Datastore`_ below)"
msgstr ""
"Eliminar el datastore desde |morpheus| (ver `Removing un Almacén de datos`_ "
"a continuación)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:101
msgid "Select the target to remove"
msgstr "Seleccionar el destino a eliminar"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:102
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:148
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Remove`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`Eliminar`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:107
msgid ""
"The iSCSI discovery database entry is removed from all online cluster hosts "
"using ``iscsiadm -m discoverydb -t sendtargets -p \"<IP>:<port>\" -o "
"delete``."
msgstr ""
"El iSCSI discovery base de datos entrada es eliminado desde todos online "
"cluster hosts usando ``iscsiadm -m discoverydb -t sendtargets -p "
"\"<IP>:<port>\" -o delete``."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:110
msgid "Expanding Storage (New LUNs)"
msgstr "Expanding Almacenamiento (Nuevo LUNs)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:112
msgid "To add additional capacity to an existing cluster:"
msgstr "Para agregar adicional capacity a un existente cluster:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:114
msgid "Provision new LUNs on your storage array"
msgstr "Provision nuevo LUNs en su storage array"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:115
msgid "Add iSCSI targets (if new portals) as described above"
msgstr "Agregar iSCSI targets (si nuevo portals) como se describe arriba"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:116
msgid "If using existing targets, trigger a rescan:"
msgstr "Si usando existente targets, trigger un rescan:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:118
msgid "sudo iscsiadm -m session --rescan"
msgstr "sudo iscsiadm -m session --rescan"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:122
msgid "Verify the new LUN is visible on all hosts:"
msgstr "Verificar el nuevo LUN es visible en todos hosts:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:124
msgid "sudo multipath -ll"
msgstr "sudo multipath -ll"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:128
msgid "Create a new HPE Clustered Datastore using the new block device"
msgstr ""
"Crear un nuevo HPE Clustered Almacén de datos usando el nuevo bloquear "
"device"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:130
msgid ""
"Each HPE Clustered Datastore (Shared LUN) maps to a single block device. To "
"add capacity, create additional datastores rather than expanding existing "
"GFS2 filesystems."
msgstr ""
"Cada HPE Clustered Almacén de datos (Shared LUN) mapea a un single bloquear "
"device. A agregar capacidad, crear adicional datastores rather than "
"expanding existente GFS2 filesystems."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:133
msgid "Removing a Datastore"
msgstr "Removing un Almacén de datos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:135
msgid ""
"All VMs must be migrated off the datastore before removal. Removing a "
"datastore with active VMs will result in data loss."
msgstr ""
"Todos VMs debe be migrado off el datastore antes de removal. Removing un "
"datastore con activo VMs será resultado en datos loss."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:140
msgid "Verify no VMs have disks on the datastore:"
msgstr "Verificar no VMs tienen discos en el datastore:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:142
msgid "Navigate to ``Storage > Datastores > [Datastore]``"
msgstr "Navegue un ``Storage > Datastores > [Datastore]``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:143
msgid "Check the :guilabel:`Virtual Machines` tab"
msgstr "Verificar el :guilabel:`Máquinas virtuales` pestaña"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:145
msgid "Migrate any remaining VMs to another datastore"
msgstr "Migrate cualquier remaining VMs a another datastore"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:147
msgid "Select the datastore to remove"
msgstr "Seleccionar el datastore a eliminar"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:151
msgid "What Happens"
msgstr "Qué Happens"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:153
msgid "The GFS2 filesystem is unmounted on all cluster hosts"
msgstr "El GFS2 filesystem es unmounted en todos cluster hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:154
msgid "The libvirt storage pool is destroyed on all hosts"
msgstr "El libvirt storage pool es destroyed en todos hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:155
msgid "Mount information is removed from ``/opt/morpheus-node/.mounts``"
msgstr "Mount información es eliminado desde ``/opt/morpheus-node/.mounts``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:156
msgid "The datastore record is removed from |morpheus|"
msgstr "El datastore record es eliminado desde |morpheus|"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:159
msgid "Heartbeat Datastore Configuration"
msgstr "Heartbeat Datastore Configuration"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:161
msgid ""
"The heartbeat datastore is used for host health detection. Each host writes "
"``hb.properties`` to the heartbeat datastore every 20 seconds, and the "
"Designated Coordinator monitors these writes to detect host failures."
msgstr ""
"El heartbeat datastore se usa para host health detection. Cada host writes "
"``hb.properties`` al heartbeat datastore cada 20 seconds, y el Designated "
"Coordinator monitors estos writes a detect host failures."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:164
msgid "Changing the Heartbeat Datastore"
msgstr "Changing el Heartbeat Almacén de datos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:167
msgid "Edit the desired datastore's properties"
msgstr "Editar el desired datastore's properties"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:168
msgid "Enable the :guilabel:`Heartbeat Target` option"
msgstr "Habilitar el :guilabel:`Heartbeat Target` opción"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:169
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Guardar cambios"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:171
msgid ""
"Only one datastore may be configured as the heartbeat target at a time. If "
"multiple datastores are marked as heartbeat targets, |morpheus| will "
"automatically select one (preferring provisioned, non-failing datastores) "
"and clear the heartbeat flag on the others. An alarm is raised when this "
"automatic selection occurs."
msgstr ""
"Solo one datastore puede be configurado como el heartbeat destino en un "
"tiempo. Si múltiples datastores son marked como heartbeat targets, "
"|morpheus| será automáticamente seleccionar one (preferring aprovisionado, "
"non-failing datastores) y clear el heartbeat flag en el others. Un alarm es "
"raised cuando este automático selection occurs."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:174
msgid "Heartbeat Datastore Best Practices"
msgstr "Heartbeat Datastore Best Practices"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:176
msgid "Use a highly reliable datastore as the heartbeat target"
msgstr "Usar un highly reliable datastore como el heartbeat destino"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:177
msgid "Ensure the heartbeat datastore is accessible from all cluster hosts"
msgstr ""
"Asegurar el heartbeat datastore es accessible desde todos cluster hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:178
msgid ""
"If the heartbeat datastore fails, VM failover detection is impaired until a "
"new heartbeat target is configured"
msgstr ""
"Si el heartbeat datastore falla, VM conmutación por error detection es "
"impaired hasta un nuevo heartbeat destino está configurado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:179
msgid ""
"Monitor the heartbeat datastore's health in the Quorum panel "
"(``Infrastructure > Clusters > [Cluster] > Summary``)"
msgstr ""
"Monitor el heartbeat datastore's health en el Quorum panel (``Infrastructure"
" > Clusters > [Cluster] > Summary``)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:182
msgid "Datastore Health Monitoring"
msgstr "Datastore Health Monitoring"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:184
msgid "|morpheus| continuously monitors datastore health:"
msgstr "|morpheus| continuously monitors datastore health:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:186
msgid ""
"**Mount status** — Each host's agent reports mount status (MOUNTED, WARNING,"
" FAILED)"
msgstr ""
"**Mount status** — Cada host's agent reports mount estado (MOUNTED, WARNING,"
" FAILED)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:187
msgid ""
"**GFS2 withdrawal** — If the GFS2 filesystem enters a withdrawn state (due "
"to journal errors or storage issues), the datastore location status is "
"updated to ``warning`` or ``failed``"
msgstr ""
"**GFS2 withdrawal** — Si el GFS2 filesystem enters un withdrawn estado "
"(debido un journal errores o storage problemas), el datastore location "
"estado es actualizado a ``warning`` o ``failed``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:188
msgid ""
"**virsh pool status** — If a libvirt storage pool is missing on a host, "
"|morpheus| recreates it automatically during the next sync cycle"
msgstr ""
"**virsh pool status** — Si un libvirt storage pool es missing en un host, "
"|morpheus| recreates it automáticamente durante el siguiente sync cycle"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:191
msgid "Datastore Status Indicators"
msgstr "Datastore Estado Indicators"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:197
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Estado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:199
msgid "Provisioned"
msgstr "Provisioned"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:200
msgid "Datastore is healthy and operational on all hosts"
msgstr "Almacén de datos es saludable y operational en todos hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:201
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Warning"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:202
msgid ""
"One or more hosts report mount issues; investigate the affected host(s)"
msgstr ""
"One o más hosts report mount problemas; investigate el affected host(s)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:203
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "Failed"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:204
msgid "All hosts report mount failures; datastore is not operational"
msgstr "Todos hosts report mount failures; datastore es no operational"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:205
msgid "Provisioning"
msgstr "Aprovisionamiento"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:206
msgid "Datastore is being created or mounted"
msgstr "Almacén de datos es being creado o mounted"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:208
msgid "For troubleshooting datastore issues, see :doc:`troubleshooting`."
msgstr ""
"Para solución de problemas datastore problemas, ver :doc:`troubleshooting`."
